	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Chalcographo, quem tu mihi tuis in literis commendasti, libenter fuissem grati<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ficatus, si ullo modo potuissem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum ipsemet coram expertus est <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>a nescio quo eximie sibi esse illusum spe magnae haereditatis proposita <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>a matre videlicet relictae, quae extremae tamen egestatis intuitu in h<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ospitale nostrum excepta, et liberaliter quidem prope tribus mensibus, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quam voluit, exquisita luculentaque alimonia adusque supremum ha<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>litum fota et tractata est.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Distraxit ipsa suppellectilis suae partem, ne <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>vacuis prorsus manibus acciperetur, quatuor interim aureis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> filio missis, et tunica quoque, quam quinque puto aureis aestimavit<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ea de re et ipse <persName ref="p6650">Spitzius</persName>, quicquid ei negatum est, tam urgentib<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>us <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>de caussis consulit boni, et agnoscit, plurimum beneficii nostrorum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>commiseratione in dulcissimam matrem esse collatum.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>De victoria <persName ref="p19065">principis electoris</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich I. von Sachsen</persName> siegte am 2. März bei <placeName ref="l2396">Rochlitz</placeName> gegen <persName ref="p18250">Moritz</persName>.</note> certum est, et recentibus literis a vir<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>is <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>honestissimis nostri mercatores rem ipsam, ut obtigit, acceperunt, quarum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>compendium senatus noster <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> senatui summisit, quod et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tibi, ut legas, dabitur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Est et <persName ref="p7364">Rossensis <span type="pronoun">ille</span> Martinus</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p7364">Martin von Rossem</persName>.</note>, qui <placeName ref="l808">Belgis</placeName> hac<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>tenus omnibus terrori fuit, a <placeName ref="l61">Premensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><placeName ref="l61">Bremen</placeName>.</note> et urbibus <placeName ref="l822">Germanicis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>maritimis magna clade profligatus, unde et <persName ref="p3590">Hessum</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> animum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>resumpsisse et instruere se ad bellum sustinendum fertur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Arrigere <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>autem et urbes aures dicuntur nec aliud cupere magis, quam dira <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>illa <placeName ref="l875">Hispanorum</placeName> hominum panolethria sublevari.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sola interim <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName> et laudem et praemium constantię feret.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l491">Argentorato</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>bene speratur; sed senem illum <persName ref="p9708">Wirtenbergensem</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p9708">Ulrich von Württemberg</persName>.</note> <persName ref="p18538">caesaris</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> genua osculatum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>esse ferunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Utinam sint, qui avitam <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> virtutem postliminio <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>revocatam gloriose vindicent!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1055">Frechtus</persName> schedam potius quam epistolam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dedit<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">16. Februar/20. März (<persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW VI 598-601, <ref target="file11561">Nr. 1518</ref>).</note>, spei plenam, sed trepide tamen circumspectam et solita carentem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>libertate, quod mirum non est in tanto Corycaeorum coetu.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Iubet tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>te cum tuis omnibus salvere, et in tuorum albo censeri summopere cupit.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Librum istum e <placeName ref="l267">Colonia</placeName> missum lego libenter et gaudeo, in <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>adversis tanta cum asseveratione gloriae Christi persistere <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>senem illum et vere reverendum principem <persName ref="p8462">episcopum</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8462">Hermann von Wied</persName>.</note>, quem solum <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in tota ferme <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> video dignum esse, qui apostolicę <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>functionis successor habeatur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dominus illum conservet inco<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>lumem eventibus laetis et auspicatis.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et me <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ama.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Mittam librum, ubi perlegero; continuam enim lectionem crebra mihi negocia non <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>concedunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">S. Galli</placeName>, nono calendas aprilis anno 1547.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Praestantissim<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>o viro domino <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, clarissimae urbis <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> epis<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>copo, domino et amico sumopere colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
